WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.090
Here we introduce the features and workflow of Quick Access & Staging

2
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.320
In our massive project structures

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.660
the file explorer contains deeply nested folder hierarchies

4
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.580
When we need to frequently edit specific files

5
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.220
we often have to dig deep through directories to find them

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.040
and once folders are collapsed to look for other files

7
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.320
recently edited paths are difficult to relocate

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.060
causing workflow interruptions and friction

9
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.720
To solve this pain point

10
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.150
I developed this Quick Access & Staging tool

11
00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:35.860
Simply select common files in the explorer and right-click

12
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:40.460
to choose 'Add to Staging' or 'Pin as Favorite

13
00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.370
After adding expand the toolbar panel below

14
00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.040
and you can clearly see these files gathered in the staging area

15
00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:52.560
making it effortless to jump back to active files anytime

16
00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:55.420
Furthermore this tool supports very convenient interactions

17
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.160
You can drag files directly from the list into the AI chat box

18
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.210
to quickly inject file context

19
00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.680
and right-clicking any item in the list

20
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:08.240
not only reveals the file in the file explorer with 1-click

21
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:12.760
but also lets you toggle between pinned favorites and temporary staging

22
00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:16.380
greatly boosting productivity in multi-file collaborative workflows
